    "turn_text": "U.S. Congressman Jared Huffman joins us. Welcome to Cannabis Economy. I'm your host Seth Adler. Download episodes on canaconomy.com. That's two ends in the word economy or wherever you currently get your podcasts. We've got a ton of direct insight over at canaconomy.com from business science and policy leaders. So go over there for that and listen to this from Cana Swiss and then U.S. Congressman Jared Huffman. Canis Swiss has built a team of experts focused on quality and care above all else. Customers are partners on the path to greater health and the Canis Swiss team is dedicated to providing top-of-the-line hemp products. The entire Canis Swiss offering is created from organic cannabis from the Swiss Highlands, ecologically formed, lab processed and purified in their own facilities, which adhere to the strictest safety and quality standards, all while utilizing the latest in pharmaceutical science and equipment. Working out of their brand new facility in Colik and Switzerland, Caniswiss uses the most advanced indoor grow science known to date, and they're constantly working to push the boundaries of cultivation knowledge forward. Caniswiss already has partners all over the globe. Go to caniswiss.com to learn more. I feel like we should promote the podcast right at the top. Why not?",
